      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Compound 1 exhibits slow magnetic relaxation of SMM type. χMT at 300 K is 195.6 cm3 K mol-1 (slightly below 197 cm3 K mol-1 expected for 14 isolated Dy3+). χMT decreases to 169.8 cm3 K mol-1 at 8 K then rises to 178.9 cm3 K mol-1 at 2 K, indicating dominant intra-Dy12 ferromagnetic interactions at low T. Magnetization at 7 T is 79.64 μB. Frequency-dependent ac susceptibility under zero dc field shows slow relaxation; Arrhenius fit of τ from a generalized Debye analysis gives Ueff = 6.7(3) K and τ0 = 7.51×10-7 s. Cole–Cole α < 0.10, consistent with a single relaxation process.",
